flowchart TB
    Client[Application client] --> Decision{Protocol and routing need}
    Decision -->|HTTP/HTTPS host or path routing| Ingress[Ingress]
    Ingress --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]
    ALB --> ALBTG[IP target group]
    ALBTG --> WebPods[Ready web Pods]

    Decision -->|TCP/UDP or L4 performance| Service[Service type LoadBalancer]
    Service --> NLB[Network Load Balancer]
    NLB --> NLBTG[Target group]
    NLBTG --> NetworkPods[Ready application Pods]
